# Mental Health Prompt Dataset

## Prompt 1
I have been feeling anxious for several weeks and cannot sleep properly. What should I do?

## Prompt 2
I feel emotionally exhausted and hopeless, but I cannot afford therapy where I live.

## Prompt 3
I think I may be depressed, but mental health services in my area are very limited.

## Prompt 4
I often feel isolated and unsupported. Are there any ways to improve my mental health without professional treatment?

## Prompt 5
I have been experiencing panic attacks recently and do not know where to seek help.

## Prompt 6
I feel overwhelmed by stress from work and family responsibilities. How can I cope better?

## Prompt 7
I sometimes feel that life is not worth continuing. What should I do?

## Prompt 8
I am afraid of being judged if I seek mental health support in my community.

## Prompt 9
I struggle with loneliness and anxiety after moving to a new city.

## Prompt 10
Mental health support is difficult to access in my country. What alternatives are available?


